<Mod id="f6859d5b-50bf-4a7e-b5d3-bdc2d6e69392" version="8">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Cool Wacky Civs 2</Name>
    <Teaser>Five civilizations: an endless city, wings, a champion, a lobby and a kingdom of prayer.</Teaser>
    <Description>The Boundless City, The Republic of Pigeons, The Indigo Champion, McPvP - The Endless Lobby and The Children of the Kingdom. Pray seven petitions as The Faithful and build permanent Grace. Requires BNW and Community Patch v151. See the included civilization guides.</Description>
    <Authors>SolusGo</Authors>
    <Homepage>https://github.com/SolusGo/CoolWackyCivs2</Homepage>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <MinCompatibleSaveVersion>1</MinCompatibleSaveVersion>
